WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
 Hello Mr. Nicholas. Hi, how are you? I'm doing good, thank you for asking. Mr. Nicholas, what is your impression of TASC KSA?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
 So, Reem, thank you, it's a wonderful question for you to ask me and I would like to tell you that TASC has been a real partner for us in Saudi Arabia.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:28.000
 It's not just an agency. You know, we were launching the imaging business in Saudi Arabia across your entertainment destinations for a major player.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:37.000
 And the TASC team really came through during this process and helped us out, you know.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.000
 You all understand the market. TASC understands the market. They know the base of the industry, of the entertainment industry.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:53.000
 You'll get that. That's most crucial for me as a client, you know. So, the team has been very responsive. You're very compliant.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:01.000
 And you make expanding into a new market much less complicated. That's one of the main reasons I would love working with you.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:06.000
 That's great. How was your experience with TASC’s recruitment team?

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:22.000
 So, with the recruitment team, very positive, to be honest. We had, you know, very tight launch dates across multiple locations as well as a lot of moving targets and a lot of moving pieces with everything, you know, around the region.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.000
 But you helped us build our first site team, be it manager, multiple guest associates.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:35.000
 And you all took care of everything. You all understood what we needed. And, you know, that is something which is very crucial.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:46.000
 You all took care of the onboarding, of the hiring, of the recruitment. And that allowed me and my team to actually concentrate on the training aspect, you know, and getting things done.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:54.000
 So, like for the recruitment team, be it shortlisting, paperwork, onboarding. That's something which you all specialize in and you all handle.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:00.000
 So, we can focus on, you know, what's important to us, like training and getting the operations underway.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000
 That's great. What are your views on the Saudi national talent landscape?

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:13.000
 To be honest, I think the Saudi national talent pool is really exciting.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:23.000
 Everyone that I've met, both in person and online, has been very energetic. They've been very, you know, all having an ambition.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:28.000
 They take real pride in welcoming, you know, guests to these destinations.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:34.000
 They want to be part of the 2030 vision. Entertainment is a growing sector. It's a booming sector.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:40.000
 And each and every one of them, which I've met, actually want to be part of it, which is very important.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:44.000
 They love to grow into leadership roles as well. They're very commanding in that.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:51.000
 I think with the right training and support and guidance, Saudi nationals are, you know, going to be growing up.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:56.000
 They just don't want to fill roles. They are there to shape the guest experience.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:00.000
 And that's one thing which is very positive for us.

